== The Economic Equation & Trade-offs


What does this actually cost us in delivery velocity, cognitive load, and cash?

Silicon Valley marketing promises effortless acceleration, but the real equation is about the maintenance tail. When systems construct software autonomously, who gets paged at 2 a.m. when an unverified divergence slips past the automated test suite?

